Hello All!  My name is Gil and callsign is KQ4ICR.  I recently got a 1701 and I have installed OpenGD77 on it.   I have only been a Ham for a couple of years.  I have really been into digital modes, because I have not lived where I can put up an antenna.  It has been a rough year, I resigned from my job as a teacher because of an ethical conflict with the county, my wife died, my dog died, and I had a stroke.  all in the span of 4 months.  Radio has kept me going these last few o has kept me going and I look forward to learning  more here.  i live with family in Florida as I continue my recovery.<br><br>Thanks for the membership,<br><br>Gil 73<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=8717">KQ4ICR</a> — Mon Jun 02, 2025 10:42 pm</p><hr />
